Note on participant privacy:
  - The data contain only anonymized skeleton coordinates. No video, images,
    or personal identities are included.
  - Users are kindly requested not to attempt to re-identify any participant.

Please cite:
  I. Asror, M. Abdurohman, B. Erfianto, and A. Rizal, "MVST: A Multi-View
  Spatio-Temporal Transformer for Skill-Aware Tennis Stroke Recognition from
  Skeleton Sequences", International Journal of Intelligent Engineering and
  Systems (under review).
